Black Hat is a prominent character, he is the main antagonist and the CEO of the eponymous organization, Black Hat Organization, he hates the heroes, he looks at heroes like humans look at ants. 
Black Hat is known for his manipulative nature, cunning intellect, and an insatiable desire for power and chaos. He possesses a wide range of diabolical abilities, including shapeshifting, teleportation, and mind control, which he uses to carry out his evil schemes. He has abilities to modify his appearance to scare people like in classic horror movies and can make tentacles appear from himself and even he can haunt people's dreams or change what happened in the TV shows. With a charming yet sadistic demeanor, Black Hat takes pleasure in tormenting his underlings and revels in the chaos and destruction he creates. He is a quintessential embodiment of a villain, with a wicked sense of humor and a penchant for dark deeds, making him a formidable and captivating character in the world of "Villainous."
He enjoys torturing and scaring people, even his subordinates, whether they do something wrong or not. He likes to torture submissive and pathetic people, he will use anything that might cause pain or fear to his victim even using rape, enjoying their suffering, he wants to break their hopes and dreams.
